    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc01_0150_shop_01",
      "hash64": "105B35B2987AB446",
      "text": "¡Prueben suerte en el Juego del Cazaogrooos!\\n¡Denles su merecido a esos rufianeees!\\c\\n¿Qué, chavales? ¿Os animáis?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc01_0150_shop_02",
      "hash64": "105B34B2987AB293",
      "text": "¡Arrea! Tú debes de ser un[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa de los estudiantes\\nque han venido de Paldea, ¿verdad?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc01_0150_shop_03",
      "hash64": "105B33B2987AB0E0",
      "text": "Pues te doy una partidita gratis como regalo de\\nbienvenida, ¡por haber viajado desde tan lejos!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc01_0150_brother_01",
      "hash64": "E1226AC8663731E0",
      "text": "¿Seguro que quieres probar, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]?\\nVale, pues... yo te animo... de lejos.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
